   "text": "login \u2192 gw:session:<jti> = { player_id, roles, opened_at }\nevery request reads it: revoked \u2192 401 SESSION_REVOKED\nPOST /api/players/logout marks the session revoked\nmiss \u2192 rebuilt from the signed token (nobody is logged out)",
