   "roundness": null,
   "text": "every key above goes through it\nMD5 \u2192 32-bit position \u00b7 160 virtual nodes per Redis node\nbinary search: the first node point clockwise owns the key\nowner down \u2192 the next distinct node clockwise\none Redis connection per node \u00b7 250 ms command timeout",
